abstract: >-
  A guided synthetic demo of purpose-specific consent, requesting-team permissions,
  and regional healthcare data access. The browser workspace uses deterministic
  fixtures and tab-local activity, with a nine-checkpoint walkthrough hosted on
  GitHub Pages. A separate local reference backend uses FHIR R4, HAPI stores,
  a Go gateway, OPA policy, and OPAL consent distribution. The project supports
  learning, product review, and implementation experiments; it is not a clinical
  system, production health information exchange, or certification claim.
